        <mxCell id="card_enclave_c" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#1a73e8;&quot;&gt;Pattern C: Dynamic Hybrid Tiering&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;• Standard Tenants on Shared Pooled Runtime (Pattern A)&lt;br/&gt;• Enterprise Tenants routed via Private Service Connect (PSC)&lt;br/&gt;• Zero-Downtime Live Migration between Tiers&lt;br/&gt;• Unified Hub-and-Spoke Governance &amp;amp; Consolidated FinOps&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1a73e8;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;spacingLeft=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
